{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13d5_level_act13d5_04_beg","groupId":"act13d5","stageId":"act13d5_04","title":"辉煌盾工业","storyCode":"MN-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"409769ff5e23c504134664e06d16a0bae2e5233833da989895b81c8979ccb59b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"终于浮出水面的发言人开始私下联络赛事，佐菲娅也与玛莉娅敲定了接下来的战略——参加大混战。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 4上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"3:49 P.M.  天气/晴   卡西米尔四城联合，某私人露天阁楼"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......您来了，莫布先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是您啊，之前在竞技场见到您的时候，您说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那些都无所谓，别这么紧张，请坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"请容我重新自我介绍一下——请叫我恰尔内，本次骑士协会赛区轮换负责人之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"同时也是梅什科集团骑士竞技与宣发部门执行人，被有幸选中成为商业联合会驻赛区发言人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"商、商业联合会？请一定要原谅我先前的无礼，恰尔内先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说，我并不讨厌您的......语言风格，“大嘴莫布”，或者说，我该称呼您的本名？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，开个玩笑而已......看看外面，多壮丽的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"有些老人家讨厌这样钢筋水泥的丛林，讨厌这白昼黑夜不分的都市，但要我说，这才是文明进步的象征。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"广袤的森林和草原当然是卡西米尔的一部分，但是强韧的卡西米尔人在林间的空地上建立起了高楼广厦，这是一件值得自豪的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这样我们才能躲避天灾侵袭，才能形成足以抗拒外敌的坚固阵线。卡西米尔如今一片繁荣，进步迅速......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"您说对吗？莫布先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"当然！您说的对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"但卡西米尔的进步尚未抵达尽头，我们还有很长的路要走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"比如......莫布先生，您知道在您的故乡，被称为“林萌与匠人之都”的奥格尼斯科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"在其方圆千里之内，有多少贫穷的村庄，有多少不受城邦庇护的险地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您知道得可真清楚，我离开那儿已经有二十多年啦。不过您为什么要和我说这些？说实话，我现在惴惴不安的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"坦诚也是我中意您的一点。我是来告诉您一件事，莫布先生，为了我们共同的进步，您被挖角了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？但我刚拿了呼啸守卫的定金......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"请放心，这份秘密合同上有帕维尔先生的印章，而您从今天开始的雇主就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我现在是梅什科公司的人啦！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"可以这么说......但也有点小小的不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"现在起，你是我的人了，主持人先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_courtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今天就到这里为止吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？但我还可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过犹不及！你才刚痊愈没多久，库兰塔身体再结实也没你这么折腾的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——那姑母，上次和你提过的源石技艺打法能不能再陪我琢磨一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......昨天不是和你说过了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我昨晚看了莱塔尼亚骑士的战斗录像，我觉得其实有可以借鉴的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又熬夜了！我说过要好好休息的吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"看来恢复得不错，这下那两个老家伙总算可以放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，马丁叔？你怎么来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"你说为什么......因为这个啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"找上门来的赞助商，整整十三家，其中倒是有一些排得上名号的大企业......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呜啊，这个辉煌盾是那个军火厂商吧......这种企业原来还会培养竞技骑士的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是些骑士团邀请，虽然数字让人心动，但结果而言都只是成为傀儡而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅！你可千万别被这种资本家迷惑了啊？！这种程度姐姐也可以负担得起的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......我是没被骗到啦，不过姑母你就这么给我花钱也怪不好意思的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钱什么的，就是想花就花啦，我买这块地的时候也是这么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（所以“花园”变成“草场”了吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......明明拒绝了那么多企业，光靠奖金和刚退役的那几年就能变出这么大一份家业，不愧是你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"总而言之，我只是把文件带到而已，省得玛恩纳啰嗦。剩下的，你们俩自己考虑吧，如果没什么事的话，也可以来酒吧放松一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......怎么办？玛莉娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我也说过，我不希望临光家的家徽变成企业的附属......但现在的我也做不到和他们平起平坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还要继续下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。也不光是钱的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，爷爷和爸妈拼命捍卫了一生的“临光”，不会只是证券所的数字和线条而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅......好吧，既然如此，那就把这些全部扔掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果下定决心要入围特锦赛，那我们必须更快地夺得积分——没有参与竞技骑士团的独立骑士就是这么麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如那个被赞助商坑惨了的瑟奇亚克，他一个人在竞速赛和决斗赛里就几乎攒够了整支队伍的总积分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后再巧妙地利用安排好的积分转移规则，这样真正的骑士团底牌在海选阶段根本就不用出阵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"所以接下来，要和那么多支骑士团队伍对抗吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，所以就要用点特殊手段......在不浪费赛事资格的情况下，办法可不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎各位来到炎刃竞技场——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"十五支队伍！十五位骑士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"本日的赛事仅此一场！掠夺，混战，逃跑，追逐！在这总面积为卡西米尔第三大的人造竞技场里，发挥骑士厮杀的天性！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？赢得一场比赛才能结算一次积分！？没有那么麻烦的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里！你对身边任何一位骑士的任何一次有效攻击，都会被判定为有效分数，转化成积分，再变成成堆的钞票！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"但是只懂得捧红胜利者的比赛是没有看头的！我知道，我知道各位真正想看的是什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想要的是英雄落幕，你们想看巨星的陨落！没错！本赛季的混战赛制将新增“扣分项目”，骑士们！风险与回报并存！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"积分稳步上涨岂不是太无趣了点！？本次赛事中，积分采取“掠夺制”！简而言之，每有人加一分，就有人扣一分！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦，是啊，我也迫不及待看着那些游刃有余的新星选手们被分而食之啦！这可是前所未有的，切实颠覆排名的赛事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"想要在家泡澡喝酒就能入围特锦赛吗！？那就冒着把本赛季的积分全部赔光的风险，在这场比赛大展拳脚吧！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，来自雷神工业赞助的无人机将全程转播骑士们的视角！八位骑士协会注册裁判不会看漏任何一个细节！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士们正在做最后的调整，工作人员将把感应芯片粘在护甲上。今天，将诞生多少明星，又会有多少骑士一败涂地！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们等待——骑士入场——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么又是这个家伙？他不该老老实实呆在呼啸守卫的地盘吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"他也跟着平步青云了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......扣分？以往的混战赛有“扣分”这个说法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"在比赛前才宣布新增赛制，这种事情他们也干得出来！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们还是低估了协会的肆意妄为......这可不是什么好兆头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，十五位骑士已经在各自的就位点准备就绪！等工作人员离开，比赛就将正式打响！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"战斗将持续整整六十分钟！除非可怜的骑士们真的全体倒下，否则，战斗到最后一刻为止——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"就算赛季积分已经变成负数也不会强制退场，这才是绝地反击的最佳看点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，玛莉娅·临光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......只是你的一位粉丝罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"好——！十五位骑士已经全部确认就绪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的粉丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们长话短说吧，锈铜骑士刚养好伤就被咱家的小灰送回医院了，哎呀，英格拉家族这几周可真是多灾多难啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"我宣布——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的粉丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"因为小灰抢了我的出赛权，搞得我现在有点闲得慌，所以来这里赚点积分。不过万万没想到能遇上小临光你啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的粉丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"——不如，我们过两招吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"诶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——炎刃混战，正式开始——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
